                <head><hi rendition="#bold">Tab A</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center">“THE PROBLEM OF ALIGNMENT”</p>
                <p>In Part II, “Policy Conclusions”, there is a split opinion in paragraph 11, on
                    page 7, regarding preferential assistance to allies. It is suggested that in
                    order to reconcile this difference you propose adding to the State proposal the
                    following: “having due regard for the preferable position of such countries from
                    the point of view of U.S. interests.”</p>
            </div>
